{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_22", "source_id": "66879467000000001c02516a", "title": "10年痘肌变成不易长痘肤质，实用好物分享", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_66879467000000001c02516a", "topic_family": "空瓶与产品复盘", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1430, "evidence_unit_count": 43, "original_evidence_unit_count": 43, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 144, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["我亲测油豆机是可以变成不易长豆腐质的 因为我自己是长了有10年的豆豆", "那不好的油脂就会让我们长豆豆 然后脸容易暗沉 以及会很容易让我们的皮肤糊糊", "2%的超分子水洋酸 我喜欢它的原因是它又温和 但是它的效果又很好", "我觉得会上领皮肤 会肉眼可见的 越来越干净 最后一个是水羊酸的身体肤", "都改善了很多很多 身体变得很光滑", "像我以前也买了 很多的酸类的身体肤 但是我坚持问不下来 因为大部分的那种酸的身体肤", "你皮肤一样可以养得很好很健康 首先我觉得一定要有一个能够调节油脂的护肤品"], "retained_quotes": ["像我以前也买了 很多的酸类的身体肤 但是我坚持问不下来 因为大部分的那种酸的身体肤", "你皮肤一样可以养得很好很健康 首先我觉得一定要有一个能够调节油脂的护肤品"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_66879467000000001c02516a/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_66879467000000001c02516a/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_66879467000000001c02516a/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_66879467000000001c02516a/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "dd8023d143d6a9f2ff9fe23cb4b282970119a21d00c293e87c90676677200024", "card_hash": "df82c2e6326ae8667bec61465e80e5bf1830d9cddf0c96b673aacc0f791e36a0", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_22", "source_id": "66852e43000000001c0264d6", "title": "3年没去美容院，皮肤反而更好了", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_66852e43000000001c0264d6", "topic_family": "毛孔与清洁", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 837, "evidence_unit_count": 21, "original_evidence_unit_count": 21, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["已经对美容院祛魅了，3年没去过，皮肤没有变差，反而比之前更好更稳定", "做好毛孔清洁是好皮肤的基础（但不能过度清洁", "3、油皮一定要试试，酸和A 这三年我不去美容院，皮肤还能保持在水光肌的状态，靠的就是这俩成分", "准备个两三组护肤搭配，相互搭着用，会比你死磕一套效果好得多", "❤️ #油痘肌护肤[话题]# #如何拯救痘痘肌[话题]# #我的护肤日常[话题]# #护肤分享[话题]#", "下面几点是我这几年一直坚持的护肤理念 1、雷打不动一周做一次家庭版毛孔深层清洁，因为我是油痘皮，毛孔非常容易堵塞，不做清洁皮肤就会看起来粗糙，有颗粒感，而且涂护肤品总吸收不进去", "3、油皮一定要试试，酸和A 这三年我不去美容院，皮肤还能保持在水光肌的状态，靠的就是这俩成分"], "retained_quotes": ["下面几点是我这几年一直坚持的护肤理念 1、雷打不动一周做一次家庭版毛孔深层清洁，因为我是油痘皮，毛孔非常容易堵塞，不做清洁皮肤就会看起来粗糙，有颗粒感，而且涂护肤品总吸收不进去", "3、油皮一定要试试，酸和A 这三年我不去美容院，皮肤还能保持在水光肌的状态，靠的就是这俩成分"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_66852e43000000001c0264d6/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_66852e43000000001c0264d6/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_66852e43000000001c0264d6/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_66852e43000000001c0264d6/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "1541ce05f31d6220f888b1b94820a8396f905a9cc08c8d3bb2187a3fdd9886e7", "card_hash": "ad3124cae175bf5948